## Cross-Cutting Rules

### Provenance
Every artifact records: source path/URL, timestamp, owner, target mapping.

### Redaction
No secrets, credentials, or sensitive production data. Redact and record.

### Evidence
Every run produces: JUnit XML/JSON, human summary, diagnostics, provenance.

### Security
No hardcoded secrets. Input validation. Parameterized queries. Dependency scanning.

